# --- Published tree is deliberately minimal ---
# Only what Claude Code needs to install and run this plugin is committed on
# main: the manifests, the hook registrations, and the compiled bundles that
# actually execute. The TypeScript source, tests and build tooling live on the
# development branch and in the git tag, so the published repo stays readable
# at a glance.
